  "138": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the storyboard grid. Use it only for the cut, the camera, and the blocking. Do not take face, hair, body, or costume from <Picture 1>. The storyboard has Chinese subtitles and English text on the panels. Ignore all of it. Do not generate subtitles. Do not generate any text from the storyboard. Do not copy any writing from <Picture 1>. No captions. No on-screen text. No shot numbers. No panel labels. No Chinese or English writing. No text overlay. No burned-in dialogue. No watermark. No subtitles in the video.\n<Picture 2> is the location, Begonia bedchamber, night candles. Environment locks to <Picture 2>. Do not take people from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 1> is Ying Wulan from <Picture 3>. Face, hair, and clothes lock to <Picture 3>, not to <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is Wu Yurong from <Picture 4>. Face, hair, and clothes lock to <Picture 4>, not to <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 3> is the wedding matron from <Picture 5>. Face, hair, and clothes lock to <Picture 5>, not to <Picture 1>.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for Wu Yurong only. Do not carry its words into the target video. Do not invent a new voice.\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] A 12-second live-action cut. No subtitles. No captions. No on-screen text. No text overlay. <Picture 1> guides the cut only. <Picture 2> is the location.\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: weak_reference - cut, camera, and blocking only. Do not take face, hair, costume, text, subtitle, or dialogue from it.\n<Picture 2>: fully_preserved - the location, lighting, and set. No people from this picture.\n<Subject 1> (appears in the shots): fully_preserved - face, hair, and clothes from <Picture 3>.\n<Subject 2> (appears in the shots): fully_preserved - face, hair, and clothes from <Picture 4>.\n<Subject 3> (appears in the shots): fully_preserved - face, hair, and clothes from <Picture 5>.\n<Audio 1>: reference - its vocal timbre guides the delivery of Wu Yurong only. Do not invent a second voice.\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] At 00:00.000, follow panel 1 of <Picture 1> for the cut only. Medium shot, Static Shot. The stepmother's hand places a gold scale into the matron's empty tray; the matron bows.. Only Wu Yurong moves their mouth. Do not give this line to anyone else. Use only the named audio. Do not invent a new voice. Wu Yurong says <d>[Chinese] 拿着。等会儿不管看见什么，嘴都闭严实点啊。</d> No subtitle. No text on screen. No captions. No on-screen text. No burned-in dialogue. No watermark. Hold to 00:04.000.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, follow panel 2 of <Picture 1> for the cut only. Medium shot, Static Shot. On the paper window, the stepmother's shadow tucks the cloth into her sleeve.. Only Wu Yurong moves their mouth. Do not give this line to anyone else. Use only the named audio. Do not invent a new voice. Wu Yurong says <d>[Chinese] ……收好。这帕子比十万两还顶用呢。</d> No subtitle. No text on screen. No captions. No on-screen text. No burned-in dialogue. No watermark. Hold to 00:08.000.\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000, follow panel 3 of <Picture 1> for the cut only. Medium shot, Static Shot. A red candle flame jumps; his right hand wrapped in white silk clenches into a fist, dry blood on the split on the back of the hand.. No one speaks. Every mouth stays closed. Do not give anyone a voice. Do not invent a voice. No talking. No lip movement. No speech sound. No subtitle. No text on screen. No captions. No on-screen text. No burned-in dialogue. No watermark. Hold to 00:12.000.\noverall_soundscape:\nCandle, breath. Use only the named audio. Do not invent a new voice. No subtitle.\nnon_diegetic_music:\nLow strings, very slow, no vocals. Duck under speech.\n"
    },
